  "explanation": "$B=A^{-1}$.<br />$|A|=2*4-(-3)*1=8+3=11$<br />$\\operatorname{adj}A=\\begin{bmatrix} 4 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 2 \\end{bmatrix}$<br />So $A^{-1}=\\frac{1}{11}\\begin{bmatrix} 4 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 2 \\end{bmatrix}$<br />Thus: $B=\\frac{1}{11}\\begin{bmatrix} 4 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 2 \\end{bmatrix}$<br />Verify $AB$ gives $I$.",
